+    # armed when 2W exceeds the output chunk: the engine rebuilds its detector
+    # at every requeue, so a 2W window would never fill (R782 review). A second,
+    # collector-only detector catches periods up to 1.25W once 3 copies fill
+    # its window (R783: a ~710-token block repeated 6x escaped every detector);
+    # 3 copies, so one restated block (a draft rewritten verbatim) never fires.
+    # Two more collector-only rungs, (6L, 2L) and (12L, 4L), extend that to
